WEBVTT

00:01.725 --> 00:03.062
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.086 --> 00:04.421
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.445 --> 00:07.661
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.685 --> 00:13.245
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.245 --> 01:31.205
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.365 --> 01:34.605
=Episode 16=

01:52.524 --> 01:53.685
Those whom he trusts

01:54.030 --> 01:55.364
followed him into the woods.

01:56.230 --> 01:57.706
Those whom he doesn't trust

01:57.730 --> 01:59.180
were left behind.

02:00.505 --> 02:02.255
Including you, right?

02:03.155 --> 02:04.995
It's normal that His Highness
doesn't trust me.

02:05.605 --> 02:07.480
I have no loyalty to him anyway.

02:08.180 --> 02:10.155
Then why do you work as his guard?

02:11.165 --> 02:12.165
Aren't you the same?

02:14.130 --> 02:15.356
Now that we're talking about it,

02:15.380 --> 02:17.255
we all stay by His Highness's side

02:17.505 --> 02:18.805
to get what we want.

02:19.130 --> 02:20.130
I think

02:20.380 --> 02:22.005
we should scratch each other's back.

02:27.030 --> 02:28.124
The same for you as well.

02:41.655 --> 02:43.605
Of course, I haven't forgotten
Mr. God of Sword.

02:52.805 --> 02:55.080
You and Xu Xiao

02:55.405 --> 02:56.844
are not related.

02:57.805 --> 02:58.805
I guess

02:59.130 --> 03:00.780
you escorted His Highness to the east

03:00.804 --> 03:02.655
on certain conditions, right?

03:07.305 --> 03:09.780
You were once
on the top of the martial world.

03:11.205 --> 03:13.100
Do you know a martial esoterica named

03:13.124 --> 03:14.644
White Emperor Esoterica of Simplicity?

03:16.155 --> 03:17.280
To be honest,

03:17.880 --> 03:19.656
I chose to serve under the Xu family

03:19.680 --> 03:21.261
for this very esoterica.

03:21.285 --> 03:22.981
If you remember this,

03:23.005 --> 03:25.301
I'm willing to serve under you.

03:25.325 --> 03:26.325
Get lost!

03:31.330 --> 03:32.930
I'll leave you be, sir.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.765
A beast passed by.

03:55.480 --> 03:56.480
Jiang Ni.

03:56.530 --> 03:57.755
Is she in danger?

03:58.080 --> 03:59.205
I don't think so.

04:03.430 --> 04:05.181
Aren't you afraid that I'll tell this

04:05.205 --> 04:06.580
to Xu Fengnian?

04:07.280 --> 04:08.530
Say whatever you like.

04:08.980 --> 04:10.630
The fact that you're after something

04:11.280 --> 04:12.980
only reassures them.

04:21.280 --> 04:23.980
If the Lin family knows
White Emperor Esoterica of Simplicity,

04:24.630 --> 04:26.180
I can change side to serve under you.

04:31.480 --> 04:33.130
My name is Lyu Qiantang.

04:50.855 --> 04:51.855
Jiang Ni!

05:04.755 --> 05:05.755
Are you okay?

05:06.405 --> 05:07.405
Look.

05:07.530 --> 05:08.530
What?

05:13.655 --> 05:14.655
Wow.

05:15.580 --> 05:16.780
Hukui.

05:17.205 --> 05:18.284
It's dead.

05:19.280 --> 05:21.031
I wonder what could kill it.

05:21.055 --> 05:22.130
I saw it.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.230
It ran over before my eyes.

05:24.280 --> 05:25.406
It didn't attack you?

05:25.430 --> 05:26.140
No.

05:26.164 --> 05:26.956
It didn't even stop,

05:26.980 --> 05:27.882
and ran away directly.

05:27.906 --> 05:29.030
What does it look like?

05:29.730 --> 05:31.680
It ran too fast.
I didn't see it clearly.

05:32.105 --> 05:34.155
It was black-and-white

05:34.930 --> 05:36.981
and was carrying a person.

05:37.005 --> 05:38.101
They flashed by.

05:38.125 --> 05:39.125
I only saw his back.

05:39.430 --> 05:41.125
The person carried a sunflower.

05:41.455 --> 05:43.181
Have you heard of such a person
in the martial world?

05:43.205 --> 05:44.244
Not really.

05:44.555 --> 05:45.325
Watch out.

05:45.505 --> 05:46.524
It isn't entirely dead.

06:02.980 --> 06:04.405
A pregnant mother.

06:04.930 --> 06:06.130
And she's about to give birth.

06:06.405 --> 06:08.325
What a
once-in-a-million-year opportunity.

06:08.964 --> 06:09.964
When a Hukui is born,

06:10.130 --> 06:10.780
once it opens its eyes,

06:11.105 --> 06:12.741
it would take the first creature
it sees as its parent.

06:12.765 --> 06:14.630
If you're the first person
that the whelp sees,

06:14.955 --> 06:16.455
you can domesticate the beast.

06:42.405 --> 06:44.006
The female came out first.

06:44.030 --> 06:45.630
The male came out after.

06:46.580 --> 06:48.005
Sister and brother.

06:49.505 --> 06:50.500
They'll open their eyes soon.

06:50.524 --> 06:51.805
Let them see you.

07:07.005 --> 07:08.445
The mother is covered with injuries.

07:08.880 --> 07:10.505
Yet her belly is fine.

07:11.305 --> 07:13.555
It was fighting to protect her children.

07:15.805 --> 07:16.930
Grandpa Wei.

07:18.555 --> 07:19.855
Fortune and luck

07:20.180 --> 07:22.055
can be obtained,

07:23.030 --> 07:25.190
but a mother shouldn't be taken
away from the children.

07:33.855 --> 07:35.105
Guys,

07:36.830 --> 07:38.630
this is your mother.

07:39.980 --> 07:41.164
Watch her closely.

07:42.205 --> 07:44.130
And remember her with your hearts.

07:49.005 --> 07:50.264
Don't ever forget her.

07:51.330 --> 07:52.524
Her eyes.

08:26.555 --> 08:28.130
Your mother is dead.

08:38.555 --> 08:40.030
They really treat you

08:40.505 --> 08:41.630
as their family.

08:42.055 --> 08:43.460
I'm not your dad.

08:43.484 --> 08:45.030
I'm not lying to you.

08:48.805 --> 08:49.930
So unfriendly.

08:50.230 --> 08:51.421
Don't bite her.

08:51.445 --> 08:52.455
She's with me.

08:53.925 --> 08:55.080
It's God's will.

08:56.355 --> 08:57.531
These two Hukui

08:57.555 --> 08:59.244
are predestined to be with you.

08:59.755 --> 09:01.380
They need names, right?

09:07.430 --> 09:08.755
You're the big sister.

09:08.955 --> 09:10.456
I'll call you

09:10.480 --> 09:11.480
Bodhisattva.

09:11.630 --> 09:12.455
You're the little brother.

09:12.605 --> 09:13.605
Your name is Vajra.

09:14.280 --> 09:15.501
The names are too difficult for them.

09:15.525 --> 09:16.525
Yeah.

09:17.255 --> 09:17.994
Bodhisattva.

09:18.155 --> 09:19.155
Vajra.

09:19.580 --> 09:20.355
Bodhisattva.

09:20.530 --> 09:21.530
Bajra.

09:22.780 --> 09:23.780
Bodhisattva.

09:24.955 --> 09:26.205
They understand you.

09:26.830 --> 09:27.830
Vajra.

09:30.005 --> 09:31.220
The elder sister is like a mother.

09:31.244 --> 09:32.555
She's teaching her brother.

09:34.305 --> 09:35.855
Can I touch them?

09:40.130 --> 09:40.860
Don't be afraid.

09:40.884 --> 09:41.884
It's fine.

09:49.364 --> 09:51.080
They have scales since little.

09:54.205 --> 09:56.364
Their mother has two horns.

09:56.724 --> 09:58.081
How come they are single-horned?

09:58.105 --> 09:59.705
And they have different colors.

10:00.080 --> 10:01.940
After they grow up,
they will have two horns.

10:01.964 --> 10:03.380
And their colors will change.

10:03.630 --> 10:04.630
Your Highness,

10:04.925 --> 10:05.731
every part of a Hukui

10:05.755 --> 10:06.755
is a treasure.

10:06.980 --> 10:08.460
Her scales can be made into

10:08.484 --> 10:09.484
impenetrable armor.

10:09.530 --> 10:10.880
It's no worse than Fujiang Armor.

10:11.530 --> 10:12.630
Bury her.

10:13.430 --> 10:14.630
You want nothing?

10:17.305 --> 10:19.180
She gave me her children.

10:20.330 --> 10:21.330
And that's enough.

10:33.855 --> 10:34.855
Let's go.

10:36.455 --> 10:37.341
Which way?

10:37.365 --> 10:38.421
We travel across Qingcheng,

10:38.445 --> 10:39.341
and use the waterway.

10:39.365 --> 10:41.485
We float down the river
and head straight to Qingzhou.

10:42.055 --> 10:43.055
Get into the carriage.

10:53.325 --> 10:54.855
Where did you get the baby Hukui?

10:55.355 --> 10:57.005
Very ballsy of you.

11:04.055 --> 11:04.860
What are you looking at?

11:04.884 --> 11:05.884
A fine sword.

11:09.255 --> 11:10.207
Xu Xiao said,

11:10.231 --> 11:11.405
he can't hold a sword.

11:12.230 --> 11:13.381
Your mother's Daliang Dragon Sparrow.

11:13.405 --> 11:14.764
You recognize it?

11:15.124 --> 11:16.630
Don't be nervous, little girl.

11:16.805 --> 11:17.980
The sword has been used by
a woman for too long.

11:18.004 --> 11:19.055
It doesn't suit me.

11:22.605 --> 11:24.965
(The Sword Bears No Guilt
The Sword Appeases All Unfairness)

11:25.205 --> 11:26.205
Hey,

11:26.230 --> 11:28.405
won't you say goodbye to your aunt?

11:28.580 --> 11:30.680
I've said what I needed to say.

11:30.830 --> 11:32.480
Travel east on the water,

11:32.855 --> 11:34.056
and you'll reach Qingzhou.

11:34.080 --> 11:36.155
Beware of the Lord of Jing'an
Zhao Heng.

11:36.705 --> 11:37.740
In North Liang,

11:37.764 --> 11:39.205
I learned what he's capable of.

11:39.655 --> 11:41.405
When the late emperor passed away,

11:41.555 --> 11:43.155
his eight sons fought over the heirship.

11:43.805 --> 11:45.580
The Lord of Jing'an almost

11:45.604 --> 11:46.621
got to sit

11:46.645 --> 11:47.755
in the throne.

11:48.445 --> 11:50.205
He's a scheming

11:50.955 --> 11:52.220
and resourceful man.

11:52.244 --> 11:54.130
He's no worse than
the emperor of Liyang.

11:56.325 --> 11:57.325
Don't worry, aunt.

11:57.685 --> 11:59.805
As long as North Liang still
has the 350,000-man army,

12:00.004 --> 12:01.404
Zhao Heng wouldn't dare to kill me.

12:02.165 --> 12:03.325
I hope so.

12:05.380 --> 12:07.084
The Lord of Jing'an.

12:08.805 --> 12:10.605
I quite look forward to

12:11.380 --> 12:13.505
finding out what kind of person
he really is.

12:39.230 --> 12:41.780
(Lord of Jing'an of Liyang Zhao Heng)

12:48.205 --> 12:49.381
My lord.

12:49.405 --> 12:50.856
(The Richest Man of Qingzhou
Wang Linquan)

12:50.880 --> 12:53.244
All the businesses
of the Lin family in Qingzhou

12:53.455 --> 12:55.964
are under control.

12:56.555 --> 12:59.181
The financial data

12:59.205 --> 13:00.445
is all written in the books.

13:01.105 --> 13:01.981
My lord,

13:02.005 --> 13:03.445
(Account Book)
would you take a look?

13:04.180 --> 13:06.484
It's kind of a shame.

13:07.755 --> 13:09.755
Such a large family

13:10.155 --> 13:11.730
was ruined.

13:14.280 --> 13:15.884
I wonder

13:16.380 --> 13:19.764
how many people in the Lin family
still live in the world.

13:20.230 --> 13:22.004
I'm on it.

13:22.405 --> 13:24.080
I promise I'll weed them all out.

13:24.255 --> 13:26.525
The Lin family will never rise again.

13:28.480 --> 13:30.130
Benevolence.

13:30.655 --> 13:32.205
Benevolence first.

13:34.830 --> 13:35.830
Father.

13:36.855 --> 13:37.832
You're here, too, Mr. Wang.

13:37.856 --> 13:38.925
Hail, Your Highness.

13:40.030 --> 13:41.530
What is it?

13:42.005 --> 13:43.700
(Zhao Xun, son of Jing'an)
A student of Shangyin Academy

13:43.724 --> 13:44.805
came to us with a ruse,

13:44.905 --> 13:46.030
and asks to see you.

13:48.244 --> 13:49.925
You personally introduced him?

13:50.555 --> 13:52.484
I'm afraid

13:53.005 --> 13:54.285
what the student is going to say

13:54.355 --> 13:57.124
happens to suit your will, right?

14:01.530 --> 14:02.530
Never mind.

14:03.005 --> 14:04.445
Bring him to me.

14:05.380 --> 14:06.380
Yes.

14:26.355 --> 14:27.355
Go.

14:36.230 --> 14:37.525
It's flying towards North Liang?

14:38.430 --> 14:39.430
Yes.

14:40.005 --> 14:41.755
When someone gets the tassel,

14:42.180 --> 14:43.925
they will head to Qingzhou.

14:44.355 --> 14:45.565
At critical moments,

14:45.955 --> 14:47.355
they will go to His Highness's aid.

14:47.505 --> 14:48.685
What if

14:48.955 --> 14:51.084
Xu Fengnian doesn't
break into Qingyang Sect?

14:51.325 --> 14:53.630
If he doesn't
break into Qingyang Sect,

14:53.930 --> 14:54.930
it means

14:55.030 --> 14:56.541
he's discreet

14:56.565 --> 14:58.244
and overcautious.

14:59.430 --> 15:01.100
So he won't be in any major trouble

15:01.124 --> 15:02.405
in Qingzhou.

15:02.830 --> 15:04.165
Therefore,

15:04.305 --> 15:05.645
he won't be needing the aid.

15:05.930 --> 15:06.930
Does Xu Xiao

15:07.305 --> 15:09.764
even have to test his own son?

15:10.355 --> 15:11.860
One's nature is only shown

15:11.884 --> 15:13.325
at pivotal moments.

15:14.680 --> 15:16.505
His Highness didn't let me down.

15:16.780 --> 15:18.884
He inherited the good qualities
of Her Grace.

15:42.380 --> 15:43.445
Old man,

15:43.555 --> 15:45.364
the boat moves so fast.

15:45.555 --> 15:47.124
Can you catch any fish?

15:50.480 --> 15:51.525
Seriously?

15:58.980 --> 15:59.980
Father.

16:00.555 --> 16:03.124
This is the student
of Shangyin Academy.

16:08.680 --> 16:09.730
Zhao Kai.

16:10.630 --> 16:11.930
Hail, My Lord.

16:14.605 --> 16:16.124
You have a ruse for me?

16:23.130 --> 16:24.764
I've still got business to attend to.

16:25.005 --> 16:26.541
I'll excuse myself out.

16:26.565 --> 16:28.724
Stay here and listen, Mr. Wang.

16:29.555 --> 16:30.805
You can speak.

16:34.230 --> 16:35.964
You've been governing Qingzhou

16:36.480 --> 16:37.884
for nearly twenty years.

16:38.955 --> 16:40.285
Have you ever thought about

16:41.455 --> 16:42.565
moving forward?

16:55.080 --> 16:56.541
What do you mean

16:56.565 --> 16:57.484
by moving forward?

16:57.555 --> 16:59.700
The imperial court put you in Qingzhou

16:59.724 --> 17:01.580
because they expected you
to intimidate North Liang

17:01.604 --> 17:02.661
with the power of Qingzhou navy.

17:02.685 --> 17:04.100
If North Liang falls,

17:04.124 --> 17:06.524
it'll be your feat.

17:06.730 --> 17:08.645
So you'll rise higher consequentially.

17:10.180 --> 17:12.205
North Liang has a 350,000-man army.

17:12.230 --> 17:13.470
Who can do anything about that?

17:14.630 --> 17:16.004
To destroy North Liang,

17:16.180 --> 17:17.181
a war isn't essential.

17:17.205 --> 17:18.605
You only have to kill one person.

17:19.130 --> 17:20.085
Who?

17:20.130 --> 17:21.205
Xu Fengnian.

17:32.230 --> 17:35.044
Are you God of Sword
or God of Fish?

17:35.180 --> 17:36.964
You fish faster than a fishing net.

17:37.680 --> 17:39.661
I'm using the hook as a sword.

17:39.685 --> 17:41.605
I'm not fishing but stabbing the fish.

17:42.305 --> 17:43.901
You really are a great martial artist.

17:43.925 --> 17:44.964
So-so.

17:45.205 --> 17:46.445
How great are you?

17:46.855 --> 17:48.004
Want to call me Master?

17:49.330 --> 17:50.845
Why can't you hold a sword?

17:52.055 --> 17:53.845
Ever since I lost to Wang Xianzhi,

17:53.930 --> 17:55.080
I haven't held a sword.

17:55.655 --> 17:56.821
Xu Xiao thinks my heart

17:56.845 --> 17:58.485
is filled with humiliation
and bellicosity

17:58.530 --> 18:00.085
and that once I hold a sword,

18:00.480 --> 18:01.448
I'll lose control

18:01.472 --> 18:02.555
and run amuck.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.685
Will you?

18:04.105 --> 18:05.105
No.

18:05.955 --> 18:08.706
Because what Xu Xiao doesn't know is,
the reason I never hold a sword again

18:08.730 --> 18:10.101
is not because of my defeat.

18:10.125 --> 18:11.125
Why, then?

18:14.705 --> 18:16.260
It's because one person

18:16.284 --> 18:17.484
died before my eyes.

18:20.105 --> 18:21.105
A woman?

18:24.605 --> 18:26.205
Who was she?

18:30.905 --> 18:31.905
Jiang Ni.

18:32.005 --> 18:33.005
Hmm?

18:33.330 --> 18:35.724
Do you know
why I want you to be my disciple?

18:37.830 --> 18:39.484
Because I'm gifted.

18:39.930 --> 18:41.685
Not only that.

18:43.855 --> 18:45.205
What else?

18:45.855 --> 18:47.524
You being around Xu Fengnian

18:48.430 --> 18:49.804
is like

18:50.305 --> 18:51.764
she being around me back then.

18:52.955 --> 18:54.645
I want to teach you swordsmanship

18:54.705 --> 18:56.925
so that you can be better
than Xu Fengnian.

18:57.280 --> 18:58.085
This way,

18:58.180 --> 19:00.044
he won't neglect you.

19:01.655 --> 19:02.940
Even if someday,

19:02.964 --> 19:04.524
he becomes as crazy as me,

19:04.605 --> 19:06.045
you'll be able to keep him in check,

19:07.155 --> 19:08.445
preventing him from making

19:08.530 --> 19:10.165
unmendable mistakes.

19:14.355 --> 19:17.004
Are you saying the woman was…

19:21.955 --> 19:23.804
She was killed by me.

19:39.580 --> 19:40.580
Father,

19:40.705 --> 19:41.705
what do you think?

19:43.830 --> 19:46.004
A load of fallacies.

19:46.580 --> 19:47.925
But he's right.

19:48.380 --> 19:49.901
Once we kill Xu Fengnian,

19:49.925 --> 19:51.700
Xu Xiao will rebel.

19:51.724 --> 19:52.724
Xu Xiao's rebellion

19:53.180 --> 19:54.905
isn't necessarily a bad thing.

19:55.105 --> 19:56.524
The world would be in chaos.

19:57.605 --> 19:59.205
What's good about that?

20:01.505 --> 20:02.980
Chaos needs to be handled.

20:03.555 --> 20:04.680
And in the chaos,

20:05.055 --> 20:06.220
you'll have the opportunity

20:06.244 --> 20:07.484
to fight for

20:07.630 --> 20:09.284
the throne.

20:16.680 --> 20:18.564
Kick him out of my mansion.

20:19.105 --> 20:19.821
Father.

20:19.845 --> 20:20.732
If he enters the door again,

20:20.756 --> 20:22.516
he'll be decapitated
and shown to the public.

20:39.180 --> 20:40.484
The ambition

20:42.255 --> 20:44.205
in the kid's eyes

20:44.530 --> 20:46.564
is the same as mine back in the days.

20:48.780 --> 20:51.125
He was raised by you,

20:51.905 --> 20:53.925
so he's undoubtedly aspirational.

20:54.580 --> 20:55.780
The kid that

20:55.804 --> 20:57.445
I'm talking about is Zhao Kai.

20:58.205 --> 20:59.205
Oh.

21:00.230 --> 21:02.524
He's but a student.

21:03.405 --> 21:05.885
What can he do no matter
how ambitious he is?

21:07.005 --> 21:08.804
But it happens that

21:11.605 --> 21:13.724
his family name is Zhao, too.

21:20.305 --> 21:21.445
The Lin family

21:21.580 --> 21:23.125
hasn't been weeded out yet.

21:23.655 --> 21:26.044
I'm off to the business.

21:27.330 --> 21:29.324
Do what you need to do, Mr. Wang.

21:35.680 --> 21:36.845
Xu Fengnian

21:37.405 --> 21:38.885
is about to arrive in Qingzhou.

21:39.830 --> 21:41.964
Are you really going to let him go?

21:43.755 --> 21:45.365
Be kind.

21:46.305 --> 21:48.284
Be benevolent.

22:02.255 --> 22:04.205
Why did you agree to

22:04.305 --> 22:06.085
send Xu Fengnian to Wudi City?

22:07.555 --> 22:08.300
Enough.

22:08.324 --> 22:09.004
No more questions.

22:09.030 --> 22:11.484
I can tell others about the deal
I made with Xu Xiao.

22:12.430 --> 22:14.030
Unless you're willing to be my disciple.

22:14.805 --> 22:16.085
Whatever.

22:17.830 --> 22:19.484
Are you ready?

22:20.555 --> 22:21.555
Ready for what?

22:23.005 --> 22:25.020
He's going to Wudi City.

22:25.044 --> 22:27.244
It means you're going
to confront Wang Xianzhi again.

22:27.480 --> 22:28.821
Pretty good.

22:28.845 --> 22:30.460
I've refrained myself for years,

22:30.484 --> 22:31.844
and I can really use a good fight.

22:32.405 --> 22:34.956
There aren't many worthy
opponents for me in the world.

22:34.980 --> 22:36.484
Wang Xianzhi is the worthiest one.

22:36.755 --> 22:37.780
Can you win?

22:37.804 --> 22:38.805
I'm not sure.

22:39.455 --> 22:40.531
At the time,

22:40.555 --> 22:42.004
I lost by a neck.

22:42.330 --> 22:43.564
But now,

22:43.855 --> 22:45.661
I may have gotten rusty because
I haven't touched a sword for long.

22:45.685 --> 22:46.780
But that's okay.

22:46.804 --> 22:48.324
Fights are just for fun.

22:48.564 --> 22:50.005
Don't think about the result.

22:52.005 --> 22:53.645
I hope you win.

22:54.355 --> 22:55.445
Thank you, then.

22:59.755 --> 23:00.755
Right now,

23:01.130 --> 23:02.764
no one is nice to me.

23:04.005 --> 23:05.005
You're quite nice.

23:05.630 --> 23:06.630
What?

23:06.780 --> 23:07.501
Want

23:07.525 --> 23:08.645
to call me Master?

23:13.880 --> 23:14.880
You can have it.

23:17.205 --> 23:18.381
I lend it to you.

23:18.405 --> 23:20.165
Give it back to me
right after the fight.

23:20.780 --> 23:22.564
You lend me the Divine Token?

23:23.630 --> 23:24.630
You recognize it?

23:27.930 --> 23:29.405
I recognize it right away.

23:29.805 --> 23:31.205
The National Treasure of Chu State.

23:31.605 --> 23:33.365
You're just going to
lend it to me like this?

23:34.280 --> 23:35.645
Chu State doesn't exist anymore.

23:36.005 --> 23:37.445
It's just a dagger.

23:50.505 --> 23:52.445
You're not going
to run amuck, are you?

23:52.555 --> 23:53.540
Don't worry.

23:53.564 --> 23:54.564
I won't.

23:55.680 --> 23:56.764
I owe you one.

23:57.605 --> 23:58.422
Think about

23:58.446 --> 23:59.645
how you want me to repay you.

24:09.880 --> 24:11.480
How about you give him
some instructions?

24:15.305 --> 24:17.085
Is this how you want me
to return the favor?

24:19.480 --> 24:20.964
It's your fault.

24:21.655 --> 24:22.856
Ever since you

24:22.880 --> 24:24.020
blamed him that night,

24:24.044 --> 24:25.684
he hasn't allowed me
to read the esoterica

24:25.980 --> 24:27.885
so I made a lot less money.

24:28.480 --> 24:30.605
Y-You give him some instructions.

24:30.855 --> 24:33.061
Maybe after this stage,

24:33.085 --> 24:34.845
he'll allow me to read again.

24:43.630 --> 24:45.044
Whatever!

24:56.255 --> 24:57.456
Father has been living
a comfortable life,

24:57.480 --> 24:58.845
he's become conservative.

24:59.555 --> 25:01.020
Killing the son of Lord of North Liang

25:01.044 --> 25:02.764
without the imperial order

25:02.925 --> 25:04.305
is concerning indeed.

25:04.855 --> 25:06.205
It's a golden opportunity.

25:06.330 --> 25:07.630
We can't miss it.

25:08.730 --> 25:10.484
Filial piety is the No. 1 virtue.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.004
Your Highness,

25:12.355 --> 25:13.764
you should relieve His Lordship

25:14.680 --> 25:15.885
from the worry.

25:21.964 --> 25:23.480
Are you suggesting I do it?

25:30.155 --> 25:31.755
I can.

25:32.355 --> 25:33.380
It's just

25:33.780 --> 25:35.555
now that Xu Fengnian is
out of North Liang,

25:35.855 --> 25:37.780
I'm afraid he's secured by
top martial artists.

25:37.804 --> 25:38.804
Your Highness.

25:39.230 --> 25:40.324
Look over there.

25:47.430 --> 25:48.182
That guy?

25:48.206 --> 25:50.885
If you would like to clear
Xu Fengnian's guards,

25:51.380 --> 25:52.605
he's your guy.

26:00.980 --> 26:01.980
Kiddo.

26:04.305 --> 26:05.305
Sir?

26:07.280 --> 26:08.280
Don't come over.

26:10.280 --> 26:11.280
Don't bite me.

26:12.205 --> 26:13.205
Don't bite me.

26:16.280 --> 26:17.300
Stop.

26:17.324 --> 26:18.445
Don't sit there and watch.

26:18.630 --> 26:19.830
Vajra, Bodhisattva, come back.

26:24.005 --> 26:25.005
Vajra.

26:29.780 --> 26:30.861
You two

26:30.885 --> 26:31.980
can't bite people.

26:32.004 --> 26:33.755
Senior is benevolent and kind.

26:33.780 --> 26:35.964
If he means to kill you,
I can't stop him.

26:37.555 --> 26:39.006
You don't have to
euphemistically beg for mercy.

26:39.030 --> 26:39.862
I'm not that cruel

26:39.886 --> 26:41.484
to harm these two little fellows.

26:42.455 --> 26:44.044
I thank you on behalf of them.

26:44.180 --> 26:46.656
You're quite a lucky guy.

26:46.680 --> 26:48.131
A few years later,

26:48.155 --> 26:49.964
these two little guys will be
top fighters.

26:50.080 --> 26:52.341
I never planned to raise them
into top fighters.

26:52.365 --> 26:54.004
People change.

26:55.080 --> 26:56.220
You wanted to speak to me, Senior?

26:56.244 --> 26:57.500
Practicing Dahuangting

26:57.524 --> 26:58.764
without the martial moves

26:59.080 --> 27:00.181
is not going to take you anywhere.

27:00.205 --> 27:01.525
Draw Xiudong out of the scabbard.

27:06.705 --> 27:08.004
Are you going to instruct me?

27:15.105 --> 27:16.484
Keep the blade above it.

27:18.055 --> 27:19.055
Too high.

27:20.255 --> 27:20.964
Good.

27:21.205 --> 27:22.341
Flick the blade.

27:22.365 --> 27:23.431
Try to smash the walnut.

27:23.455 --> 27:24.455
Okay.

27:41.430 --> 27:43.724
Smash the walnut, but don't leave
any traces on the deck.

27:44.030 --> 27:45.030
Again.

27:52.430 --> 27:54.260
You read Compendium of Swords
for nothing.

27:54.284 --> 27:56.044
What's the balance
of swordsmanship?

27:57.705 --> 27:58.685
Don't look at me like that.

27:58.724 --> 27:59.682
I know it's a blade.

27:59.706 --> 28:00.901
But the principle is the same.

28:00.925 --> 28:02.940
I just started reading
Compendium of Swords,

28:02.964 --> 28:04.101
I didn't read too much.

28:04.125 --> 28:05.740
Why didn't you?

28:05.764 --> 28:07.831
You said the book was ridiculous

28:07.855 --> 28:08.940
and misleading.

28:08.964 --> 28:09.964
Yeah.

28:10.305 --> 28:11.421
Think about

28:11.445 --> 28:13.125
how I broke Fujiang Armor
with a waterdrop.

28:13.180 --> 28:15.430
Think about how I flicked.

28:35.805 --> 28:37.220
Hone your skills.

28:37.244 --> 28:38.724
With your
capability of comprehension,

28:38.755 --> 28:40.205
I doubt you can make it.

28:40.705 --> 28:42.244
Only smash the walnut.

28:42.280 --> 28:43.780
No damage to any other stuff.

28:55.480 --> 28:57.484
Do you know the Sword Tomb
of the Wu family?

28:58.630 --> 28:59.724
Of course, I do.

28:59.905 --> 29:02.131
A cradle of sword masters.
A forbidden place.

29:02.630 --> 29:04.004
There's a genius swordsman

29:04.430 --> 29:06.524
from the Wu family.

29:07.680 --> 29:08.740
He left the Sword Tomb

29:08.764 --> 29:10.180
at the age of twenty

29:11.405 --> 29:13.056
to challenge swordsmen across the world

29:13.080 --> 29:14.381
and has never suffered a defeat.

29:14.405 --> 29:15.405
The person

29:16.180 --> 29:17.031
(Sword Champion of Sword Tomb)
is the new hope of the Wu family.

29:17.055 --> 29:17.882
(of the Wu family Wu Liuding)
is the new hope of the Wu family.

29:17.906 --> 29:18.955
Wu Liuding.

29:20.030 --> 29:21.085
Are you finished?

29:21.205 --> 29:21.981
I need to buy some salt.

29:22.005 --> 29:23.125
You're expecting Xu Fengnian

29:23.180 --> 29:24.564
here in Qingzhou, aren't you?

29:27.505 --> 29:28.985
Does it have anything to do with you?

29:31.005 --> 29:32.020
The Mansion of Lord of Jing'an

29:32.044 --> 29:34.231
offers to find Xu Fengnian's
whereabouts for you.

29:34.255 --> 29:36.484
You'll hear from us
as soon as we get any information.

29:40.530 --> 29:41.540
What do you want?

29:41.564 --> 29:43.165
We only wish

29:43.755 --> 29:44.964
to watch you fight.

29:51.105 --> 29:54.445
Why would the Wu family
attack Xu Fengnian?

29:54.805 --> 29:56.260
Xu Fengnian's mother

29:56.284 --> 29:58.004
once left the Sword Tomb for Xu Xiao.

29:58.355 --> 29:59.885
Now, the new generation

30:02.080 --> 30:03.355
came to settle the score.

30:29.980 --> 30:31.205
Still practicing?

30:31.480 --> 30:32.804
A reminder for you.

30:33.030 --> 30:34.885
If you succeed a few days later,

30:35.030 --> 30:36.530
stack one walnut on another,

30:36.564 --> 30:37.507
and then…

30:37.531 --> 30:38.730
And then flick the blade,

30:39.055 --> 30:40.056
smash the walnut,

30:40.080 --> 30:41.244
make sure the deck is fine.

30:42.855 --> 30:44.044
I've done it.

30:44.830 --> 30:45.757
How is it possible?

30:45.781 --> 30:47.101
You started practicing from noon.

30:47.125 --> 30:48.324
Don't lie to me.

30:59.605 --> 31:01.845
You're quite talented.

31:04.630 --> 31:06.324
Then why are you sitting here?

31:06.555 --> 31:08.165
I'd like to try three walnuts.

31:08.330 --> 31:09.724
I tried several times,

31:10.305 --> 31:11.381
but I never made it.

31:11.405 --> 31:12.357
When I flicked the blade,

31:12.381 --> 31:13.406
the walnut at the bottom

31:13.430 --> 31:14.645
would be struck away.

31:14.955 --> 31:17.004
Is two the limit?

31:17.655 --> 31:18.541
Do you know the difference

31:18.565 --> 31:20.244
between Sword Move and Sword Intent?

31:22.405 --> 31:23.405
Blade.

31:35.430 --> 31:36.550
The blade didn't move a bit.

31:36.755 --> 31:37.701
How did the walnut break?

31:37.725 --> 31:39.165
This is Sword Gust.

31:40.530 --> 31:41.540
It won't work only by watching.

31:41.564 --> 31:43.125
Hold Chunlei below Xiudong.

31:46.230 --> 31:47.381
Feel carefully

31:47.405 --> 31:48.505
what Sword Gust is.

31:55.605 --> 31:56.764
I felt it.

31:56.905 --> 31:58.031
It was a strong gust.

31:58.055 --> 31:59.356
An inner force breaks out of the body

31:59.380 --> 32:00.685
through a weapon.

32:01.005 --> 32:03.406
The essence of Sword Gust
is the utilization of genuine spirit.

32:03.430 --> 32:05.020
Based on your level of Dahuangting,

32:05.044 --> 32:05.881
after several practices,

32:05.905 --> 32:06.862
you can do it, too.

32:06.886 --> 32:09.365
Sword Gust is way more powerful
than sword Move.

32:09.505 --> 32:11.105
Sword Move can't do that.

32:11.905 --> 32:13.145
Hold the blades in place again.

32:25.255 --> 32:26.445
It felt different.

32:26.705 --> 32:27.901
It felt like a force hit the blade

32:27.925 --> 32:28.980
to make Chunlei break away from me.

32:29.004 --> 32:30.244
This is Sword Move.

32:31.055 --> 32:33.205
Touch the face of Xiudong.

32:34.405 --> 32:35.411
It felt like it didn't move,

32:35.435 --> 32:36.621
but actually, there are slight tremors.

32:36.645 --> 32:37.980
At the second flick,

32:38.004 --> 32:39.324
it seemed Xiudong didn't move,

32:39.405 --> 32:41.020
but it bent

32:41.044 --> 32:42.084
at an amazingly fast speed

32:42.455 --> 32:43.581
and hit Chunlei six times.

32:43.605 --> 32:45.955
The counterforce got it back to normal.

32:46.930 --> 32:48.365
It bent six times?

32:48.655 --> 32:49.724
I didn't see anything.

32:50.005 --> 32:51.484
Good Sword Move

32:51.805 --> 32:53.700
is as fast as thunder
and as steady as mountain.

32:53.724 --> 32:54.501
Boy,

32:54.525 --> 32:55.821
you've still got much to learn.

32:55.845 --> 32:57.581
Sword Move and Sword Gust.

32:57.605 --> 32:58.661
Which is stronger?

32:58.685 --> 33:01.300
If I break an enemy with Sword Gust,
then Sword Gust is better.

33:01.324 --> 33:02.940
If I kill someone with Sword Move,

33:02.964 --> 33:05.524
then Sword Move beats
every Sword Gust in the world.

33:05.980 --> 33:06.845
I get it.

33:06.955 --> 33:07.955
You're the best.

33:08.155 --> 33:09.645
You're indeed clever.

33:10.105 --> 33:11.205
Sword Move, Sword Gust.

33:11.255 --> 33:12.460
You work on them yourself.

33:12.484 --> 33:13.980
Soon, we'll arrive in Qingzhou.

33:14.004 --> 33:16.244
I won't fight unless necessary.

33:16.680 --> 33:18.605
Whether you can dodge
all the menaces or not

33:18.905 --> 33:19.964
will be up to you.

33:23.705 --> 33:25.120
Thank you for your instructions, sir.

33:25.144 --> 33:26.445
I didn't mean to instruct you.

33:29.005 --> 33:30.061
I owe someone a favor.

33:30.085 --> 33:31.581
And I'm returning it
by instructing you.

33:31.605 --> 33:33.405
You owe a favor to whom?

33:37.055 --> 33:38.535
An inner force breaks out of the body

33:38.905 --> 33:40.680
through a weapon.

33:53.280 --> 33:54.021
Sir,

33:54.045 --> 33:55.365
I managed to perform Sword Gust.

33:55.730 --> 33:57.564
That's Blade Gust.

33:58.055 --> 33:59.085
That's true.

33:59.855 --> 34:01.101
Your strength

34:01.125 --> 34:02.102
wasn't even enough to kill a chicken.

34:02.126 --> 34:03.380
Keep practicing.

34:06.855 --> 34:08.044
The kid

34:08.530 --> 34:11.155
improves faster than I did.

34:15.780 --> 34:17.780
(Mansion of the Lord of North Liang)

34:42.555 --> 34:43.341
General,

34:43.365 --> 34:44.900
you've slept several nights

34:44.924 --> 34:46.061
in front of the mansion.

34:46.085 --> 34:47.621
Your people want to know

34:47.645 --> 34:48.965
when you will be back at home.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.645
Godfather

34:52.905 --> 34:55.605
asked me to wait for a hawk
to deliver a tassel.

34:56.155 --> 34:57.300
I won't leave

34:57.324 --> 34:58.324
until the hawk comes.

35:00.680 --> 35:01.680
What is that?

35:01.730 --> 35:02.730
A hawk.

35:02.980 --> 35:04.125
It seems like a hawk.

35:14.255 --> 35:14.941
General.

35:14.965 --> 35:15.700
I'll go check it for you.

35:15.724 --> 35:16.724
Move aside.

35:21.830 --> 35:22.924
General, be careful.

35:27.705 --> 35:29.125
The tassel.

35:31.305 --> 35:32.731
It's the tassel!

35:32.755 --> 35:34.884
You stay in front of the mansion.

35:35.105 --> 35:37.700
Once you receive the tassel from a hawk,

35:37.724 --> 35:40.844
you lead your cavalrymen
to Qingzhou at once.

35:41.105 --> 35:42.755
General, take it easy.

35:46.205 --> 35:47.820
Pass my order. We set out.

35:47.844 --> 35:50.141
Follow me to the east
to reinforce His Highness.

35:50.165 --> 35:51.420
The dispatchment of soldiers
require the tiger tally.

35:51.444 --> 35:52.501
The heck with the tiger tally.

35:52.525 --> 35:53.581
I'll execute all those who disobey me.

35:53.605 --> 35:55.205
Please put on your armor, General.

35:55.780 --> 35:57.180
I'll put on it on the way.

35:58.680 --> 36:00.431
Make way. Make way.

36:00.455 --> 36:01.900
Words from the river,

36:01.924 --> 36:03.756
Xu Fengnian will arrive at
Chunshen Lake today.

36:03.780 --> 36:05.081
Have you let Wu Liuding know?

36:05.105 --> 36:06.506
He said he's doing sword maintenance

36:06.530 --> 36:08.010
and won't take action until tomorrow.

36:08.130 --> 36:08.942
We won't wait for him.

36:08.966 --> 36:10.740
Rally the navy
and set sail to Chunshen Lake.

36:10.764 --> 36:11.964
We can't miss the opportunity.

36:22.330 --> 36:24.244
You gave the Divine Token to Senior Li?

36:27.930 --> 36:29.205
It's none of your business.

36:31.180 --> 36:32.905
Aren't you afraid
of falling into the water?

36:33.380 --> 36:34.525
I get nice views here.

36:35.305 --> 36:36.705
How about you try to sit here, too?

36:37.430 --> 36:38.884
I'm a bad swimmer.

36:41.455 --> 36:42.461
I'm here with you.

36:42.485 --> 36:43.685
You won't fall into the water.

37:21.780 --> 37:24.005
The lake is way larger than
the one in the mansion.

37:24.805 --> 37:26.125
Of course.

37:26.405 --> 37:27.730
800-long Chunshen Lake

37:27.755 --> 37:30.205
is where many waterways
and rivers rendezvous.

37:30.755 --> 37:32.844
It's always been a strategic location.

37:33.305 --> 37:35.101
The Lord of Jing'an governs Qingzhou

37:35.125 --> 37:37.820
and his navy is entrenched
in Chunshen Lake.

37:37.844 --> 37:40.085
It's his natural defense
from North Liang.

37:40.955 --> 37:43.284
You don't find another lake like this

37:43.485 --> 37:44.844
across the entire world.

37:46.980 --> 37:48.335
You talk so much.

37:50.630 --> 37:51.910
What do you want to speak to me?

37:53.155 --> 37:55.130
Your Hukui babies

37:55.305 --> 37:57.145
are stealing raw meat
from the provision cabin.

37:58.530 --> 37:59.770
They didn't hurt anyone, right?

38:00.130 --> 38:01.230
No.

38:01.655 --> 38:03.255
They are very slick.

38:03.884 --> 38:05.645
They scare others
but never hurt anyone.

38:07.305 --> 38:08.844
Leave them be, then.

38:12.804 --> 38:13.844
There's a ship over there.

38:22.430 --> 38:24.155
And another ship behind us.

38:27.844 --> 38:29.080
That's a big one.

38:42.605 --> 38:45.505
Those are Qingzhou navy's
Yellow Dragon Towered Ships.

38:47.230 --> 38:48.485
They came to look for trouble?

38:48.555 --> 38:49.764
Maybe.

38:51.630 --> 38:52.844
I see a ship over there.

38:53.605 --> 38:54.855
It's fine.

38:55.305 --> 38:57.080
That's Qingzhou navy, too.

38:58.724 --> 39:00.045
Do you think

39:00.605 --> 39:02.284
it's a coincidence

39:02.480 --> 39:04.284
or an arrangement?

39:04.655 --> 39:05.924
It must be a coincidence.

39:06.605 --> 39:08.805
I heard nothing from the Mansion
of the Lord of Jing'an,

39:09.530 --> 39:12.444
so who in Qingzhou dare
come to pick Xu Fengnian up?

39:16.830 --> 39:18.685
What does this ship want?

39:21.780 --> 39:22.924
Weird.

39:23.705 --> 39:25.764
It seems that ship is here
to pick Xu Fengnian up.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.280
Who dare pick him up?

39:31.755 --> 39:32.764
Do you know him?

39:37.230 --> 39:38.324
Wang Linquan?

39:41.830 --> 39:43.605
Are we going to fight them?

39:47.430 --> 39:48.430
Are you

39:49.705 --> 39:52.284
the son of the Lord of North Liang,
Xu Fengnian?

39:52.480 --> 39:53.480
Yes, I am.

39:56.105 --> 39:57.105
Your Highness.

39:58.155 --> 40:00.085
Did His Lordship ask

40:00.165 --> 40:01.525
Mr. Wang to appear at this moment?

40:03.630 --> 40:05.045
Your Highness.

40:15.005 --> 40:16.005
Turn back to the base.

40:18.580 --> 40:19.804
We can't attack them today

40:20.355 --> 40:22.085
in case that Father's plan is disrupted.

40:39.980 --> 40:40.980
Look so alike.

40:41.405 --> 40:42.924
Who on earth are you?

40:43.830 --> 40:46.364
I'm Wang Linquan.

40:46.705 --> 40:48.130
Hail, Your Highness.

40:49.030 --> 40:50.364
Wang Linquan?

40:50.730 --> 40:52.804
You're the money-maker under
the Lord of Jing'an?

40:54.480 --> 40:55.924
I was ordered to

40:56.755 --> 40:58.605
serve under the Lord of Jing'an.

40:58.955 --> 41:01.645
I used to be a servant of North Liang.

41:02.855 --> 41:04.844
It was His Lordship's order

41:05.755 --> 41:07.340
that Wang Linquan went to
serve under Qingzhou.

41:07.364 --> 41:08.364
You know him?

41:09.930 --> 41:12.244
I've been the secret liaison

41:13.355 --> 41:14.795
between North Liang
and Wang Linquan.

41:15.955 --> 41:18.141
So it was Xu Xiao who
sent you to Qingzhou?

41:18.165 --> 41:19.165
Yes.

41:20.105 --> 41:21.685
After decades of endeavors

41:22.030 --> 41:24.061
and the secret help of General-in-Chief,

41:24.085 --> 41:26.501
the Lord of Jing'an
has put his trust in me.

41:26.525 --> 41:27.780
The Lin family fell

41:28.130 --> 41:31.244
and the financial power of Qingzhou
was given to me.

41:31.764 --> 41:34.380
The Lord of Jing'an thinks
he's the winner of the game,

41:34.830 --> 41:36.085
but eventually,

41:36.980 --> 41:40.030
it is General-in-Chief
who gets the better of him.

41:52.205 --> 41:54.565
Decades of the under-cover job
must have been tough for you.

41:54.930 --> 41:57.605
As you kneel, all of your previous
hard work goes in vain.

41:59.804 --> 42:02.284
The day you arrive in Qingzhou

42:03.130 --> 42:07.125
is the day my identity as a liegeman
of North Liang gets reinstated.

42:09.930 --> 42:10.930
I've been

42:13.005 --> 42:15.525
waiting for this day for too long.

42:18.085 --> 42:19.525
For too long.

42:24.155 --> 42:25.804
Let's not talk about it.

42:28.255 --> 42:31.231
There's an island in the middle
of Chunshen Lake

42:31.255 --> 42:32.125
named

42:32.255 --> 42:33.364
Mount Mu.

42:33.430 --> 42:35.965
It's been under my control long ago.

42:36.430 --> 42:37.430
Your Highness,

42:37.580 --> 42:38.605
please follow me.

42:43.630 --> 42:44.630
Turn the helm.

42:44.930 --> 42:45.930
Go home.

42:51.980 --> 42:54.021
How many more tricks

42:54.045 --> 42:55.405
is Xu Xiao playing behind my back?

43:29.985 --> 43:32.705
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.480 --> 43:37.280
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.205 --> 43:42.125
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.205 --> 43:47.005
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.305 --> 43:51.205
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.905 --> 43:55.725
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.730 --> 44:00.485
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.505 --> 44:05.430
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.930 --> 44:08.661
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.685 --> 44:09.925
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.705 --> 44:14.565
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.380 --> 44:18.106
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.130 --> 44:19.565
♪ The vanity ♪

44:20.055 --> 44:23.930
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.355 --> 44:25.706
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.730 --> 44:28.565
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.980 --> 44:31.461
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.485 --> 44:33.885
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.180 --> 44:36.206
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.230 --> 44:38.406
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.430 --> 44:42.645
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:43.005 --> 44:44.141
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.165 --> 44:47.205
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.380 --> 44:49.341
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.365 --> 44:52.085
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.645 --> 44:54.461
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.485 --> 44:56.981
♪ To start over ♪

44:57.005 --> 45:01.130
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
